> Just a quesstion, currently the replicas cannot be set more than 1, I assume it is by design? With the pause field is support, whether the replicas field will be deprecated?

@lizzzcai Yes, this is by design, given that we envision this to be a singleton workload. The "pause" feature is actually implemented as /scale subresource of `Sandbox`. You can now "pause" the Sandbox by scaling it down to 0. It's very simple for now ([phase 1](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/agent-sandbox/issues/36#issuecomment-3340953487)), and more sophisticated pausing is on the roadmap. 

